  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/293/morning-glory-header.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/697/cat-good-morning.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>描述</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">提升您的猫咪晨间礼物的品质</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">支持服务端安装。您可以仅在服务端安装此模组，无需在客户端安装。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">由制作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同一作者团队开发（如需完整 RPG 体验，请获取 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，享受任务与角色扮演玩法）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>特性</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">(得益于以下特性，您的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升)&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">在原版 Minecraft 中，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTutorials%252fCat_gift_farming\" rel=\"nofollow\">晨间礼物</a>的种类可能较为有限，且很少掉落幻翼膜。本模组将玩家猫咪每天早晨赠送的礼物替换为优化后的掉落列表。请参阅下方您现在可以从猫咪处获得的晨间礼物物品清单。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0cf;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>常见</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 兔皮</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 兔子脚</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 生鸡肉</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 羽毛</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 腐肉</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 线</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 幻翼膜</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 西瓜片</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e67e23;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>略微稀有</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 钻石</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 金苹果</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 金胡萝卜</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 不死图腾</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>稀有</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 紫水晶碎片</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 海洋之心</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 凋灵骷髅头颅</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 回音碎片</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 海绵</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 试炼钥匙 (1.21+)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>极其稀有</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 末影水晶</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 鹦鹉螺壳</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 下界之星</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">- 不祥之瓶 (1.21+)&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器，与朋友们一起游戏！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 或点击下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
